#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/hello.md ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Web\\Echo;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\HydratorAttribute\\RouteArgument;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\WebViewRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private WebViewRenderer $viewRenderer,\n"
"    ) {}\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(\n"
"        #[RouteArgument('message')]\n"
"        string $message = 'Hello!'\n"
"    ): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/template', [\n"
"            'message' => $message,\n"
"        ]);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Web\\Echo;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\HydratorAttribute\\RouteArgument;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\WebViewRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private WebViewRenderer $viewRenderer,\n"
"    ) {}\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(\n"
"        #[RouteArgument('message')]\n"
"        string $message = 'Hello!'\n"
"    ): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/template', [\n"
"            'message' => $message,\n"
"        ]);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/views/asset.md ../src/guide/views/view.md ../src/guide/views/widget.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basic Concepts"
msgstr "Conceitos básicos"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/views/view-injections.md ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require yiisoft/yii-view-renderer\n"
msgstr "composer require yiisoft/yii-view-renderer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "View is responsible for presenting data to end users. You give it a template with some placeholders and presentation logic and some data. The view is passing data to the template executing template logic. The end result is ready to be passed to end user, be it a browser, a file to download, an email to send or something else."
msgstr "A view é responsável por apresentar os dados ao usuário final. Você entrega a ela um template com alguns placeholders e lógica de apresentação, além de alguns dados. A view passa os dados para o template e executa a lógica do template. O resultado final está pronto para ser entregue ao usuário final, seja um navegador, um arquivo para download, um e-mail a ser enviado ou outra coisa."

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart LR\n"
"  A[Data] --> V[View]\n"
"  B[Template] --> V\n"
"  V --> C[HTML]\n"
"  C --> D[Browser]\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart LR\n"
"  A[Dados] --> V[View]\n"
"  B[Template] --> V\n"
"  V --> C[HTML]\n"
"  C --> D[Navegador]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "In Yii3 views are typically PHP files that contain presentation logic and HTML markup. The view system provides a flexible way to organize your presentation layer and supports features like layouts and partial views. Instead of using plain PHP templates, you can leverage one of the template engines such as [Twig](template-engines.md)  or [Blade](https://github.com/lee-to/yii-blade)."
msgstr "No Yii3, as views normalmente são arquivos PHP com lógica de apresentação e marcação HTML. O sistema de views oferece uma forma flexível de organizar a camada de apresentação e suporta recursos como layouts e views parciais. Em vez de templates PHP puros, você pode usar uma das template engines, como [Twig](template-engines.md)  ou [Blade](https://github.com/lee-to/yii-blade)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "For basic view functionality, you need the `yiisoft/view` package:"
msgstr "Para a funcionalidade básica de views, você precisa do pacote `yiisoft/view`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require yiisoft/view\n"
msgstr "composer require yiisoft/view\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "For web applications, you should also install the `yiisoft/yii-view-renderer` package which provides [PSR-7](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/) compatibility and web-specific features:"
msgstr "Em aplicações web, instale também o pacote `yiisoft/yii-view-renderer`, que oferece compatibilidade com [PSR-7](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/) e recursos específicos para a web:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md ../src/guide/views/widget.md
msgid "These packages are included by default in the `yiisoft/app` application template."
msgstr "Esses pacotes já vêm incluídos por padrão no template de aplicação `yiisoft/app`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "A view template file contains presentation logic.  In the `yiisoft/app` template, view files are typically stored alongside their controllers (e.g., `src/Web/Echo/Action.php`). Here's a simple view file example, `src/Web/Echo/template.php`:"
msgstr "Um arquivo de template de view contém lógica de apresentação.  No template `yiisoft/app`, os arquivos de view normalmente ficam junto dos seus controllers (por exemplo, `src/Web/Echo/Action.php`). Este é um exemplo simples de arquivo de view, `src/Web/Echo/template.php`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "Here `$message` is a view data that is passed when you render a template with the help of `WebViewRenderer`. For example, `src/Web/Echo/Action.php`:"
msgstr "Aqui, `$message` é um dado da view passado quando você renderiza um template com o `WebViewRenderer`. Por exemplo, `src/Web/Echo/Action.php`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "First argument of the `render()` method is a path to the template file. In the `yiisoft/app`, template files are typically stored alongside their actions. The result is ready to be rendered to the browser so we return it immediately."
msgstr "O primeiro argumento do método `render()` é o caminho do arquivo de template. No `yiisoft/app`, os arquivos de template normalmente ficam junto das suas actions. O resultado já está pronto para ser enviado ao navegador, então o devolvemos imediatamente."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Working with layouts"
msgstr "Trabalhando com layouts"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "Most web applications use a common layout for all pages. In the `yiisoft/app` template, layouts are stored in `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/` directory. You can set a default layout in `config/common/params.php`:"
msgstr "A maioria das aplicações web usa um layout comum para todas as páginas. No template `yiisoft/app`, os layouts ficam no diretório `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/`. Você pode definir um layout padrão em `config/common/params.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-view-renderer' => [\n"
"        'viewPath' => null,\n"
"        'layout' => '@src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/layout.php',\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-view-renderer' => [\n"
"        'viewPath' => null,\n"
"        'layout' => '@src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/layout.php',\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "A typical layout file such as `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/layout.php` looks like this:"
msgstr "Um arquivo de layout típico, como `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/layout.php`, tem esta cara:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main\\MainAsset;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var \\App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams $applicationParams\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Aliases\\Aliases $aliases\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetManager $assetManager\n"
" * @var string $content\n"
" * @var string|null $csrf\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\View\\WebView $this\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute $currentRoute\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);\n"
"\n"
"$this->addCssFiles($assetManager->getCssFiles());\n"
"$this->addCssStrings($assetManager->getCssStrings());\n"
"$this->addJsFiles($assetManager->getJsFiles());\n"
"$this->addJsStrings($assetManager->getJsStrings());\n"
"$this->addJsVars($assetManager->getJsVars());\n"
"\n"
"$this->beginPage()\n"
"?>\n"
"<!DOCTYPE html>\n"
"<html lang=\"<?= Html::encode($applicationParams->locale) ?>\">\n"
"<head>\n"
"    <meta charset=\"<?= Html::encode($applicationParams->charset) ?>\">\n"
"    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n"
"    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"<?= $aliases->get('@baseUrl/favicon.svg') ?>\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n"
"    <title><?= Html::encode($this->getTitle()) ?></title>\n"
"    <?php $this->head() ?>\n"
"</head>\n"
"<body>\n"
"<?php $this->beginBody() ?>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"header\">\n"
"    <a href=\"/\">\n"
"        <?= Html::encode($applicationParams->name) ?>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"content\">    \n"
"    <?= $content ?>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"footer\">\n"
"    © <?= date('Y') ?>  <?= Html::encode($applicationParams->name) ?>    \n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<?php $this->endBody() ?>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
"<?php $this->endPage() ?>\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main\\MainAsset;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var \\App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams $applicationParams\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Aliases\\Aliases $aliases\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetManager $assetManager\n"
" * @var string $content\n"
" * @var string|null $csrf\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\View\\WebView $this\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute $currentRoute\n"
" * @var Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);\n"
"\n"
"$this->addCssFiles($assetManager->getCssFiles());\n"
"$this->addCssStrings($assetManager->getCssStrings());\n"
"$this->addJsFiles($assetManager->getJsFiles());\n"
"$this->addJsStrings($assetManager->getJsStrings());\n"
"$this->addJsVars($assetManager->getJsVars());\n"
"\n"
"$this->beginPage()\n"
"?>\n"
"<!DOCTYPE html>\n"
"<html lang=\"<?= Html::encode($applicationParams->locale) ?>\">\n"
"<head>\n"
"    <meta charset=\"<?= Html::encode($applicationParams->charset) ?>\">\n"
"    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n"
"    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"<?= $aliases->get('@baseUrl/favicon.svg') ?>\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n"
"    <title><?= Html::encode($this->getTitle()) ?></title>\n"
"    <?php $this->head() ?>\n"
"</head>\n"
"<body>\n"
"<?php $this->beginBody() ?>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"header\">\n"
"    <a href=\"/\">\n"
"        <?= Html::encode($applicationParams->name) ?>\n"
"    </a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"content\">    \n"
"    <?= $content ?>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"footer\">\n"
"    © <?= date('Y') ?>  <?= Html::encode($applicationParams->name) ?>    \n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<?php $this->endBody() ?>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
"<?php $this->endPage() ?>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "In the template above `$applicationParams` is an array of parameters from `config/common/application.php`."
msgstr "No template acima, `$applicationParams` é um array de parâmetros de `config/common/application.php`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "`$aliases` refers to [aliases component](../concept/aliases.md) that is used to get the base URL of the application at the server for URLs."
msgstr "`$aliases` se refere ao [componente de aliases](../concept/aliases.md), usado para obter a URL base da aplicação no servidor para montar URLs."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "`$this` is an instance of the view that we use to get page title and output assets. Both standard and custom."
msgstr "`$this` é uma instância da view que usamos para obter o título da página e gerar a saída dos assets, tanto os padrão quanto os personalizados."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With `$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);` we register an asset that defines `css` to include to the page. It is\n"
"automatically copied to `public/assets` on first use. It is not very useful for a single CSS file but becomes handy as\n"
"the number of assets grows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Com `$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);` registramos um asset que define o `css` a ser incluído na página. Ele é\n"
"copiado automaticamente para `public/assets` no primeiro uso. Isso não ajuda muito com um único arquivo CSS, mas se torna útil\n"
"conforme o número de assets cresce.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!IMPORTANT]\n"
"> No output in plain PHP templates is encoded you should not forget to use `Html::encode()` to prevent\n"
"XSS security vulnerabilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!IMPORTANT]\n"
"> Nenhuma saída em templates PHP puros é codificada, então não se esqueça de usar `Html::encode()` para evitar\n"
"vulnerabilidades de segurança do tipo XSS.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "More about what's available in layout could be read in [yiisoft/view](https://github.com/yiisoft/view) documentation."
msgstr "Você encontra mais detalhes sobre o que está disponível no layout na documentação do [yiisoft/view](https://github.com/yiisoft/view)."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rendering without layout"
msgstr "Renderizando sem layout"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "Sometimes you need to render a view without a layout (for example, for AJAX responses):"
msgstr "Às vezes você precisa renderizar uma view sem layout (por exemplo, para respostas AJAX):"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function ajaxContent(): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    return $this->viewRenderer\n"
"        ->withLayout(null)\n"
"        ->render('ajax-content', ['data' => $data]);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Or use the renderPartial method\n"
"public function ajaxContent(): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    return $this->viewRenderer->renderPartial('ajax-content', ['data' => $data]);\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function ajaxContent(): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    return $this->viewRenderer\n"
"        ->withLayout(null)\n"
"        ->render('ajax-content', ['data' => $data]);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Ou use o método renderPartial\n"
"public function ajaxContent(): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    return $this->viewRenderer->renderPartial('ajax-content', ['data' => $data]);\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nested Views and Partials"
msgstr "Views aninhadas e parciais"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rendering Sub-views"
msgstr "Renderizando sub-views"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can render other views from within a view using the `$this->render()` method:\n"
msgstr "Você pode renderizar outras views de dentro de uma view com o método `$this->render()`:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var \\Yiisoft\\View\\WebView $this\n"
" * @var \\App\\Entity\\Post[] $posts\n"
" */\n"
"?>\n"
"<div class=\"posts\">\n"
"    <?php foreach ($posts as $post): ?>\n"
"        <?= $this->render('_post_item', ['post' => $post]) ?>\n"
"    <?php endforeach; ?>\n"
"</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var \\Yiisoft\\View\\WebView $this\n"
" * @var \\App\\Entity\\Post[] $posts\n"
" */\n"
"?>\n"
"<div class=\"posts\">\n"
"    <?php foreach ($posts as $post): ?>\n"
"        <?= $this->render('_post_item', ['post' => $post]) ?>\n"
"    <?php endforeach; ?>\n"
"</div>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**src/Web/Post/_item.php**\n"
msgstr "**src/Web/Post/_item.php**\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var \\Yiisoft\\View\\WebView $this\n"
" * @var \\App\\Entity\\Post $post\n"
" */\n"
"?>\n"
"<article class=\"post\">\n"
"    <h2><?= Html::encode($post->getTitle()) ?></h2>\n"
"    <p><?= Html::encode($post->getExcerpt()) ?></p>\n"
"    <time><?= $post->getCreatedAt()->format('Y-m-d') ?></time>\n"
"</article>\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var \\Yiisoft\\View\\WebView $this\n"
" * @var \\App\\Entity\\Post $post\n"
" */\n"
"?>\n"
"<article class=\"post\">\n"
"    <h2><?= Html::encode($post->getTitle()) ?></h2>\n"
"    <p><?= Html::encode($post->getExcerpt()) ?></p>\n"
"    <time><?= $post->getCreatedAt()->format('Y-m-d') ?></time>\n"
"</article>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using Blocks"
msgstr "Usando blocos"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "Blocks allow you to define content in one view and display it in another, typically in layouts:"
msgstr "Os blocos permitem definir conteúdo em uma view e exibi-lo em outra, normalmente nos layouts:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// In a view file\n"
"<?php $this->setBlock('sidebar', $this->render('_sidebar', ['items' => $sidebarItems])) ?>\n"
"\n"
"// In the layout file\n"
"<?php if ($this->hasBlock('sidebar')): ?>\n"
"    <aside><?= $this->getBlock('sidebar') ?></aside>\n"
"<?php endif ?>\n"
msgstr ""
"// Em um arquivo de view\n"
"<?php $this->setBlock('sidebar', $this->render('_sidebar', ['items' => $sidebarItems])) ?>\n"
"\n"
"// No arquivo de layout\n"
"<?php if ($this->hasBlock('sidebar')): ?>\n"
"    <aside><?= $this->getBlock('sidebar') ?></aside>\n"
"<?php endif ?>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rendering as String"
msgstr "Renderizando como string"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "If you need the rendered content as a string instead of a PSR-7 response:"
msgstr "Se você precisa do conteúdo renderizado como string em vez de uma resposta PSR-7:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function getEmailContent(): string\n"
"{\n"
"    return $this->viewRenderer->renderAsString('email/welcome', [\n"
"        'user' => $user,\n"
"    ]);\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function getEmailContent(): string\n"
"{\n"
"    return $this->viewRenderer->renderAsString('email/welcome', [\n"
"        'user' => $user,\n"
"    ]);\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "View Events"
msgstr "Eventos de view"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
msgid "The view system triggers events during the rendering process that you can listen to:"
msgstr "O sistema de views dispara eventos durante a renderização, e você pode escutá-los:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/views/view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\View\\Event\\WebView\\BeforeRender;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\View\\Event\\WebView\\AfterRender;\n"
"\n"
"// Example event listener\n"
"final class ViewEventListener\n"
"{\n"
"    public function onBeforeRender(BeforeRender $event): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        // Add global CSS class based on view name\n"
"        if (str_contains($event->getFile(), 'admin/')) {\n"
